          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can two breakers control one outlet?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Split receptacles, especially in kitchens, can have the top and bottom halves on different circuits. Test both halves separately, and if two single breakers feed one outlet, ask an electrician whether they should be handle-tied."
